sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant View as AnalysisProcessingScreen
    participant Poll as useAnalysisStatusQuery (1.5s interval)
    participant API as GET /api/v1/analyses/:id/status
    participant Router as React Router

    View->>View: Render Circular Breathing Pulse (Honest Stage 1)
    loop Polling Loop
        Poll->>API: GET /api/v1/analyses/:id/status
        API-->>Poll: 200 OK { stage: 5, stageName: "Harmonizing multimodal signals..." }
        Poll->>View: Update UI Stage Label (No fake percentages)
    end
    API-->>Poll: 200 OK { status: 'COMPLETED', isTerminal: true }
    Poll->>Router: Navigate to `/analyze/results/:id`
    Router->>User: Render Results Screen
